OL,3,GNorth East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSunny spells
OL,6,Fin the east at first, but becoming
OL,7,Fcloudier during the evening with
OL,8,Fspells of rain punctuated by some
OL,9,Fheavier bursts moving through from the
OL,10,Fwest. Becoming drier, cooler and
OL,11,Fclearer to end the night.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTuesday:FA brighter, fresher-feeling
OL,14,Fday for many, with some warm sunny
OL,15,Fspells and a northwesterly wind.
OL,16,FCloudier at times in the north and
OL,17,Fwest, with isolated showers possible.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
